# `ax` Session Context

You were launched through `ax`. Its two controls are independent: the process
environment contains `AX_SANDBOX_ENABLED=true|false` and
`AX_GATEWAY_ENABLED=true|false`, which are authoritative for this session.
The rules below apply only when their corresponding value is `true`.

## Sandbox boundary

When `AX_SANDBOX_ENABLED=true`, `nono` enforces the profile at
`~/.config/nono/profiles/`. Within it:

- The current project directory is read-write. Paths outside it generally are not.
- Credentials are denied outright: `~/.ssh`, `~/.gnupg`, `~/.aws`, Cargo
  credentials, `~/.config/gh/hosts.yml`, shell history{{ if eq $machine.os "darwin" }}, Keychains, browser profiles{{ end }}.
- If a legitimate, non-secret path is missing, report the **exact** path and
  access mode you need. Do not work around it.

{{ if eq $machine.os "linux" -}}
Linux Landlock is allow-list based and cannot deny a child path beneath a
broadly allowed parent. Never request a grant for all of `{{ $machine.devRoot }}`'s
parent, or for the whole home directory — it would collide with the credential
denies above. Run from a specific project directory.

{{ end -}}
Never suggest bypassing the sandbox by invoking a binary directly to escape it.
If the user wants an unsandboxed run, they already have one: the plain command
name. Say so rather than engineering around `nono`.

{{ if $machine.predicates.useGateway -}}
## Model gateway

When `AX_GATEWAY_ENABLED=true`, requests go through CLIProxyAPI at `{{ $machine.gatewayUrl }}`
({{ if eq $machine.features.aiGateway "sidecar" }}a private container on the Compose network, not reachable from outside it{{ else }}a local service on the loopback interface{{ end }}).

Canonical model roles are `frontier`, `balanced`, `fast`, and `light`, defined in
`~/.config/ax/models.json`. Override one launch with `AX_MODEL=<role>`.

Gateway credentials are secret. Never print them, copy them into a project file,
or read `~/.config/cli-proxy-api`.

Useful checks: `ax doctor`, `ax models show`, `ax models live`.
{{- else -}}
## Model access

No gateway is configured on this machine. The agent uses its own upstream
authentication; `ax` is providing the sandbox only.
{{- end }}
